# Biotite Solutions website — environment variables
#
# The site is fully static and currently requires NO environment variables
# or secrets to build or deploy. This file exists so that future additions
# (analytics keys, CMS tokens, form endpoints) have an obvious home and are
# never committed with real values.
#
# Example future entries:
# PUBLIC_ANALYTICS_ID=
# SANITY_PROJECT_ID=
# SANITY_DATASET=
